{title: 087 - God Who Spoke in the Beginning}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #087 • NEW MALDEN • 8.7.8.7.8.7}
{lyricist: Fred Kaan}
{composer: David McCarthy}
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 87}
{meta: tune NEW MALDEN}
{meta: meter 8.7.8.7.8.7}
{meta: category God the Father - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Dm]God who [Gm]spoke [Dm]in [Gm]the [Am/C]beginning,
[Bb]Forming [Gm]rock [Dm]and [Gm/Bb]shaping [Dm]spar,
[Dm]Set all [Bb]life [Gm]and [F]growth in [Am]motion,
[Gm]Earthly [Dm]world [Bb]and [C7]distant [Bb]star;
[Eb]He [C7]who [Dm]calls [F/C]the [C7/Bb]earth [Am]to [Dm]order
[Gm]Is the ground [Am]of what [Dm]we are.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Dm]God who [Gm]spoke [Dm]thro' [Gm]men [Am/C]and [Dm]nations,
[Bb]Thro' [F/A]events [Dm]long [Gm/Bb]past [Am]and [Dm]gone,
[Dm]Showing [Bb]still [Gm]today [F]His [Am]purpose,
[Gm]Speaks supremely [C7]through [F]His [Bb]Son;
[Eb]He [C7]who [Dm]calls [F/C]the [C7/Bb]earth [Am]to [Dm]order
[Gm]Gives His [Am]word and it [Dm]is done.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Dm]God whose speech [Gm]becomes [Am/C]incarnate-
[Bb]Christ [F/A]is [Gm]servant, Christ [Am]is [Dm]Lord-
[Dm]Calls us [Bb]to [Gm]a [F]life of [Am]service,
[Gm]Heart [Am]and [Dm]will [Bb]to [C7]action [Bb]stirred;
[Eb]He [C7]who [Dm]uses [C7/Bb]man's [Am]obedience
[Gm]Has the first [Am]and final [Dm]word.
{end_of_verse}
